wavenet.nam and lstm.nam are copied unmodified from the example_models/ directory of
NeuralAmpModelerCore (https://github.com/sdatkinson/NeuralAmpModelerCore, commit
0b3d3c97b0859a3a8c92a8628c4dd89a25eb5842), Copyright (c) 2023 Steven Atkinson, MIT License
(see LICENSE-NeuralAmpModelerCore).

linear_*.nam are hand-written Linear-architecture fixtures for Sawblade's tests (same
format; MIT, like the rest of this directory's NAM-derived material).

cal_*.nam are synthetic Linear-architecture fixtures (identity weights) with invented input_level_dbu / output_level_dbu /
gear_type metadata, written by make_cal_fixtures.py in this directory (python3 make_cal_fixtures.py [--check]) for the v0.8
calibration tests. No TONE3000 data, no third-party audio. The only other fixtures here with calibration metadata are the two NeuralAmpModelerCore examples, wavenet.nam and lstm.nam
(both input_level_dbu 18.3 and output_level_dbu 12.3).
